- Official source name
- Official source URL
- Responsible department
- Source document / Government Order
- Source publication date
- Last verified date
- Verification status
- Version number
- Approved by
- Next review date

Verification status:

- Verified Official Source
- Pending Verification
- Outdated
- Broken Link
- Conflicting Information
- Requires Department Confirmation

Never fabricate:

- Scheme eligibility
- Benefit amounts
- Income limits
- Age limits
- Application fees
- Required documents
- Application opening dates
- Closing dates
- Processing times
- Approval status
- Government URLs
- Government API availability

If information cannot be verified, show:

"Information pending official verification. Please confirm with the concerned department before applying."

Distinguish state, central and jointly funded schemes.

Do not guarantee that a citizen will receive a scheme benefit merely because the eligibility checker identifies a possible match.

Ensure data collection, processing, retention and sharing follow applicable Indian data protection and government service requirements, including the Digital Personal Data Protection Act and applicable rules.

Apply data minimization, informed consent, encryption, access control, audit logging and secure document handling.

Do not expose citizen information through public dashboards.

